ion of activation and dominance from speech seem to be possible, the same for valence remains challenging. Previous research has shown that the use of lexical information can improve valence estimation performance.","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/investigating-model-representations","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":[],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:ub0mtvdf941ppevmhyqlqdt3","title":"Safe Real-World Reinforcement Learning for Mobile Agent Obstacle Avoidance","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/safe-real-world","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/safe-real-world"],"alternate_titles":["Safe Real-World Reinforcement Learning for Mobile Agent Obstacle Avoidance"],"published":"2022-10-11","authors":["Mario Srouji","Wei Ding","Yao-Hung Hubert Tsai","Ali Farhadi","and Jian Zhang"],"abstract":"Collision avoidance is key for mobile robots and agents to operate safely in the real world. In this work, we present an efficient and effective collision avoidance system that combines real-world reinforcement learning (RL), search-based online trajectory planning, and automatic emergency intervention, e.g. automatic emergency braking (AEB). The goal of the RL is to learn effective search heuristics that speed up the search for collision-free...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/safe-real-world","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":["agent","reinforcement learning"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:hzumc2dhifpe64okw3bka8ci","title":"Low-Rank Optimal Transport: Approximation, Statistics and Debiasing","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/low-rank-optimal-transport","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/low-rank-optimal-transport"],"alternate_titles":["Low-Rank Optimal Transport: Approximation, Statistics and Debiasing"],"published":"2022-10-11","authors":["Meyer Scetbon","Marco Cuturi"],"abstract":"The matching principles behind optimal transport (OT) play an increasingly important role in machine learning, a trend which can be observed when OT is used to disambiguate datasets in applications (e.g. single-cell genomics) or used to improve more complex methods (e.g. balanced attention in transformers or self-supervised learning). To scale to more challenging problems, there is a growing consensus that OT requires solvers that can operate on...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/low-rank-optimal-transport","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":["machine learning","self-supervised"],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:jko613woumbqrki95ssgjcg1","title":"Learning Bias-reduced Word Embeddings Using Dictionary Definitions","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/learning-bias-reduced","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/learning-bias-reduced"],"alternate_titles":["Learning Bias-reduced Word Embeddings Using Dictionary Definitions"],"published":"2022-10-11","authors":["Haozhe An","Xiaojiang Liu","Jian Zhang"],"abstract":"Pre-trained word embeddings, such as GloVe, have shown undesirable gender, racial, and religious biases. To address this problem, we propose DD-GloVe, a train-time debiasing algorithm to learn word embeddings by leveraging dictionary definitions. We introduce dictionary-guided loss functions that encourage word embeddings to be similar to their relatively neutral dictionary definition representations. Existing debiasing algorithms typically need...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/learning-bias-reduced","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":[],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:mvefnpg4wq251zm4jh546cf4","title":"Texturify: Generating Textures on 3D Shape Surfaces","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/generating-textures","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/generating-textures"],"alternate_titles":["Texturify: Generating Textures on 3D Shape Surfaces"],"published":"2022-10-05","authors":["Yawar Siddiqui","Justus Thies","Fangchang Ma","Qi Shan","Matthias Nießner","and Angela Dai"],"abstract":"Texture cues on 3D objects are key to compelling visual representations, with the possibility to create high visual fidelity with inherent spatial consistency across different views. Since the availability of textured 3D shapes remains very limited, learning a 3D-supervised data-driven method that predicts a texture based on the 3D input is very challenging. We thus propose Texturify, a GAN-based method that leverages a 3D shape dataset of an...","companies":["Apple"],"matched_orgs":["Apple"],"company_groups":["company_us"],"company_regions":["US"],"sources":["official_publication_page"],"source":"official_publication_page","work_type":"publication","doi":"","openalex_id":"","cited_by_count":0,"quality_score":52,"matched_keywords":[],"author_affiliations":["Apple"],"concepts":[],"official_report":true,"quality_signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},"evidence":[{"source":"official_publication_page","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/generating-textures","labs":["Apple"],"signals":{"company_match_source":"official Apple Machine Learning page https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"}}],"topic_evidence":{"scope":"ai","classifier_version":2,"method":"official_ai_research_catalogue","ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research","matched_terms":[],"concept_ids":[],"work_type":"publication"},"ai_research_source":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research"},{"id":"apple:rf7my0l7ogan3baae57v7btr","title":"Generative Multiplane Images: Making a 2D GAN 3D-Aware","url":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/generative-multiplane-images","paper_url":"","alternate_urls":["https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/generative-multiplane-images"],"alternate_titles":["Generative Multiplane Images: Making a 2D GAN 3D-Aware"],"published":"2022-10-04","authors":["Xiaoming Zhao","Fangchang Ma","David Güera","Zhile Ren","Alexander G. Schwing","Alex Colburn"],"abstract":"What is really needed to make an existing 2D GAN 3D-aware? To answer this question, we modify a classical GAN, i.e., StyleGANv2, as little as possible. We find that only two modifications are absolutely necessary: 1) a multiplane image style gener